            "content": "<h2>Why probiotics matter</h2><p>Your gut is the largest immune organ in your body — and the microbiome that lives inside it controls far more than digestion. A balanced microbiome influences your immunity, mood, energy, hormones, skin, sleep, and disease risk. An imbalanced one accelerates inflammation, autoimmune conditions, anxiety, and weight gain. Probiotics are the supplements that swing the balance back towards health.</p>"
